  is exercising the epoch check itself rather than incidentally tripping
  a signature failure.
- Verified the "old epoch" branch of the new ternary is presently
  unreachable in practice (the earlier guard at line 194 already throws
  for `epoch < groupContext.epoch` before this point), but left it in
  place rather than collapsing it: it keeps this check correct and
