**Learnings for future iterations:**
- Before starting a task, always check `git status`/`git diff` for
  uncommitted changes relevant to the target story -- a prior session can
  leave real, correct implementation work sitting uncommitted if it ran
  out of budget before the verify-and-commit step. In this case the
  fastest path was to independently re-verify every acceptance criterion
  against the existing diff rather than re-implementing from scratch.
