    that from addHousehold, removeHousehold, rotateDevice, removeDevice,
    sendFrom and decryptOn -- the six actions that advance state. No
    call site duplicates the save/delete logic.
  - The wrapper catches storage failures and reports them into
    `state.status`: the action itself succeeded, so a failed disk copy
    should not throw out of a click handler.
