  phone moved it again to epoch 5. Removing the persisted phone from
  the group deleted its record and the row went back to 'not
  persisted'. The send and decrypt call sites were left to the unit
  tests -- they route through the same single function, and neither
  advances the epoch, so there is nothing visible to compare in the
