    disappear trick does work for "Create X's devices", "Start group
    as X", the add/remove household buttons, and 'Remove from group'
    (which closes the whole panel).
  - Playwright here runs on a persistent profile, so records written
    to `mls-multi-device-demo` by a previous session's verification
    survive. They sit under a different group id, so they are invisible
    to `persistedIds` and never re-synced -- but they do show up in a
