  `protocol.ts`, `scripts/probe.mjs`,
  `test/example-realistic-demo/room-logic.ts`, `protocol.ts`,
  `docs/implementation-plans/2026-07-27-realistic-demo/HANDOFF.md`,
  `specs/prd.json`.
- Mutations, each applied and confirmed with `diff -q`, then restored by
  file copy: deleting the `requireMember` call fails check 20a; deleting
  `mayWriteLog`'s `isCreator` clause fails 20b and three unit tests;
  deleting its `removed` clause fails 20d. Restored and re-verified
  20/20.
