Gates: `npm test` 47652 passing, exit 0. `npm run lint` exit 0. Root
typecheck reports only the known `test/test-vectors/key-schedule.ts:73`
TS2769; the Worker typecheck prints no error lines. `build:realistic`
and `build-pages` both exit 0, and the three built demos (main,
