    mutation killed by a *different* check than the one aimed at is
    still a kill, but both have to be reported as what they are.
    `run_worker_first` pointed elsewhere fails checks 1-4, not check 23,
    which tells you the API namespace is load bearing far more widely
    than the one check that named it.
