    fetches the page, and wrangler serves it from
    `example-realistic-demo/dist`, which is gitignored. Run
    `npm run build:realistic` before `npm run worker:dev` or that one
    check fails on a fresh tree for a reason that has nothing to do with
    the Room.
  - `${PIPESTATUS[0]}` is empty in this shell -- it is zsh, where the
    array is `$pipestatus` and is 1-indexed. A probe or lint run piped to
    `tail` and then read through `PIPESTATUS` reports *no* exit code at
    all, which is easy to misread as success. Redirect to a file and read
    `$?` instead.
